@baseUrl = {{host}}/api/v1
@token = {{authToken}}

### Listar impresoras
GET {{baseUrl}}/printers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear impresora TCP
POST {{baseUrl}}/printers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Impresora Caja 1",
  "connection_type": "net",
  "address": "192.168.1.50",
  "port": 9100,
  "paper_width": 80,
  "profile": "escpos",
  "codepage": "PC850",
  "auto_cut": true,
  "cut_type": "full",
  "open_cash_drawer": false,
  "default_copies": 1,
  "role": "receipt",
  "is_default": true
}

### Detalle de impresora
GET {{baseUrl}}/printers/{{printerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar impresora
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/printers/{{printerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Impresora Caja Principal",
  "auto_cut": false
}

### Marcar como predeterminada por rol
POST {{baseUrl}}/printers/{{printerId}}/set-default
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "receipt"
}

### Generar ticket de prueba
POST {{baseUrl}}/printers/{{printerId}}/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "copies": 1
}

### Generar probe de codepage
POST {{baseUrl}}/printers/{{printerId}}/probe
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Imprimir recibo de una venta
POST {{baseUrl}}/printers/{{printerId}}/print-receipt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sale_id": "{{saleId}}",
  "copies": 1,
  "currency": "NIO"
}

### Enviar payload TCP directo
POST {{baseUrl}}/printers/send-tcp
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "192.168.1.50",
  "port": 9100,
  "ticket_base64": "REEMPLAZAR_CON_BASE64"
}

### Eliminar impresora (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/printers/{{printerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
